cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "InvarLock: Verifiable release evidence for changed open-weight models"
message: "If you use InvarLock in scientific work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
abstract: >
  InvarLock is an open release-regression assurance engine for one authenticated
  baseline-versus-subject model comparison. It prepares a deterministic schedule,
  executes or imports paired records, derives a finite-schedule decision from a
  replayable paired interval and caller-supplied policy, publishes signed canonical
  evidence, and verifies that evidence with independently supplied trust anchors.
repository-code: https://github.com/invarlock/invarlock
